+
+	/*
+	 * Currently only the AAL, CCORR, COLOR, GAMMA, MERGE, OVL, RDMA, DSI, and DPI
+	 * blocks have separate component platform drivers and initialize their own
+	 * DDP component structure. The others are initialized here.
