 *   "entry: Fix seccomp bypass after ptrace with TSYNC"
 *
 * Expected behavior:
 *   Without fix: getpid executes and child exits normally (bypass).
 *   With fix:    child is killed by SIGSYS because filter blocks getpid.
 *
